WEBVTT

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.560
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:54.520
Sensei gave me this.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:04.840
Let's see here...

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:07.810
Sports festival notice.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:08.270
To the Parent or Guardian of the Child
Sports Festival Notice
Asou Newsletter

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:12.280
A sports festival, huh?

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.120
Is everyone free next Sunday?

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:38.300
I-If you're all free...

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.950
I'm sorry, but I have plans already...

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:46.050
Grandma and I already have plans to go to the spa with the Yamadas.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.520
I'm very sorry...

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.670
I've made plans with some friends...

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.010
I see...

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:59.820
No one can come, but it's okay because I'll be there, right?

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:00.310
Yep!

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:03.470
What are you talking about, Kippei?

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.750
What?  I'm talking about the sports festival.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.430
What?!  So you mean next Sunday is...?

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.700
The day of Yuzuyu's sports festival.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.950
You idiot!  Why didn't you just say so?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.150
Yuzuyu-chan, of course we'll be there.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.580
Yes, yes, we can go to the spa anytime right, Mother?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.260
Y-yes.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.280
My friends and I are...

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.550
You are going too, Satsuki!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:29.650
It's okay!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:42.480
Yuzuyu-chan, what do you mean it's okay?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.810
Everyone seemed busy so...

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:52.020
We're not busy at all!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.020
That's right!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:03:59.700
Really?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.630
Yeah, yeah!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.820
Well, if you're going to come, we'll be more than happy.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.700
But Satsuki, you don't have to come...

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.010
Oh, it's no trouble at all.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.930
Her clothes are fine, right?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.230
Her hat is okay.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.340
Her shoes are fine too.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.430
The problem is...

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.190
her lunch.  What to do?

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:27.160
When it comes to sports festival lunches, there definitely needs to be a Jubako.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.860
I can't make just one side dish like I have been.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.100
What should I make?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.350
You're worrying too much.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:37.420
I hope you're right, but I'm concerned.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:38.770
About what?

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:43.120
Maybe she said it was okay because she didn't really want us to come.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:44.620
No way.

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:50.400
Maybe she's not good at running, or she can't dance well, so she doesn't want us to see that.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.460
Well then, maybe we shouldn't go.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:55.220
Only if that really is the problem.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:05:01.170
What we need is someone to investigate this for us.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:04.000
But who is going to investigate?

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.390
You're going to tell me to do it, right?

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.400
You're going to do it for us?

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.270
That's very helpful of you, Kippei!

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.680
Well then, please take care of it.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.690
I really don't think there's anything to worry about.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.280
Good morning!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.230
See you later!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.750
Good morning!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:32.270
Excuse me...

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.180
Yes?

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:37.730
Do you think that Yuzuyu doesn't want to attend the sports festival?

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.030
Has she said anything about it?

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:42.500
No, not really...

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:44.790
But now that I think about it...

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:49.750
when we were practicing the entrance march for the sports festival...

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:05.330
What is it, Ken-kun?  Why are you laughing?

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.470
Because...

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.460
Her arms and legs are...

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.660
What's with that walk?

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:14.640
Huh?

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:16.420
Oops...

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.420
Yuzuyu-chan, you're so funny!

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.200
You think so?

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.110
So that's what happened.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.390
But that was it.  Everything is back to normal now.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:40.340
Neither she, nor the others, seemed bothered by it.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.380
It wasn't like last time...

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.310
I guess you're right.

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.270
By the way, Kippei-san...

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.100
I mean, Katakura-san...

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:53.960
will you be coming to the sports festival?

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:55.610
Of course I'll be there.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:59.040
Really?  We'll be looking forward to it!

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:03.270
Marching, huh?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.710
Try walking from here to that tree over there.

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:25.510
Okay.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.380
But why do I have to do this?

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:41.010
Why don't we practice for the sports festival?

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:42.410
Okay!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.310
Alright, we'll practice marching.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:50.430
Begin.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:57.920
Oops.  Oops.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:58.590
Oopsie.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.540
T-Thank you, Kippei-onii-chan!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:07.960
Take it easy.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.520
I heard that everyone laughed at you.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.510
How did you know about that?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.540
Don't worry about it.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.270
We all have things we are good and bad at.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.350
I'm not really worried about it.

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:24.330
R-Really.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:25.320
Yeah.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.800
But, it'd be nice if I could do it right?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.080
That's right, wouldn't it?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.050
But...

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.300
If I can't, it's okay.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.290
I know you can do it if you try!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.070
I know it!  Let's try!

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:48.030
I'll give you pudding if you can do it.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:49.780
Pudding?!

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.090
Begin!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:13.050
Yuzuyu, do you want to try talking through it?

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:14.270
Talk?

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.030
Yeah.  One, two.  One, two.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:27.240
One, two.  One, two.

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:29.270
One, two.  One...

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:30.330
Pudding?

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:52.700
Pu...dding.  Pu...dding.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:04.340
I'm home!

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:08.870
How was it?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.670
Did you find out anything?

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.230
Come see the sports festival, okay?

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.720
Complete!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.750
Hey, hey, what's in there?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.720
You can't see it yet.  Wait until lunch.

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:48.930
Sounds like fun!

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.770
Yuzuyu-chan!  Look over here!

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.960
Yuzuyu-chan, smile!

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:58.560
Like this?

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.550
Yeah, yeah!  You're adorable!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.690
Hmm?  Where are Dad and Grandpa?

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.840
They're saving our spot.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.140
It sure is hard work.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.080
Would either of you two like a drink?

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.910
Pu...dding.  Pu...dding.

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:24.690
Don't worry, it'll go just fine.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:25.880
Yep!

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:30.690
Alright everyone, we're going to do our best!

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.120
Yay!

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.000
It's going to be so much fun.

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:46.030
Okay everyone, just like we practiced.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:49.310
Marching with lots of energy, but let's all stay in line.

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.780
Okay!

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:56.410
Pu...dding.  Pu...dding.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.450
Thank you all for waiting.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:09.900
Now it's time to present the students participating in the Asou Preschool Sports Festival.

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:23.580
Pu...dding.  Pu...dding.

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.940
Yuzuyu-chan!  Look over here!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.850
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.080
That was great everyone!  You all marched perfectly!

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:46.140
You can march now.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.340
Yep, thanks to Kippei-onii-chan!

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:52.940
What's that?  What's that about Kippei-san?

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.230
Are you okay?

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:14.630
Thank you all for coming today.

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:20.100
I know you all must be very busy, but thanks to you, we can have a healthy sports festival.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:26.770
I would now like to start the Asou Preschool Sports Festival!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.580
The game is over!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:50.330
The score so far is ten points for the red team, and eight points for the white team.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.970
The red team takes the lead!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.160
What?!  We'll take the lead after the dancing competition!

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:58.970
What?

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:03.280
Marika-chan, the dancing competition doesn't have any points.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:06.820
Kippei-san, please watch me dance!

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:26.500
Ken-kun.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.140
That's right.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.570
Thank you, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.780
I was about to mess up back there.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.600
Why is that?  Why don't we get points for dancing?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.330
We tried to tell her.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.440
But she wouldn't listen to us.

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:03.860
Could everyone entering the ball tossing contest please gather over here.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.580
Alright!  Get going Satsuki!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.020
Me?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.420
Yes, you.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:20.720
Start!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.660
Do your best Satsuki!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.610
What are you doing? Hey, Satsuki!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.190
That's amazing!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.000
Yep.

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:57.970
Is that person Kippei-san's younger brother?

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.710
Yeah, that's Satsuki-onii-chan!

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:03.150
Satsuki-san...

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.980
Kippei-san's nice, but Satsuki-san is so wonderful too...

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.020
I'm so torn!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:15.000
The morning session is now over.

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.610
The afternoon session will start after lunch, at one o'clock.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.600
Well then everyone, let's go have lunch!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.790
Lunch!  Lunch!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:37.750
Tada!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.600
What's this?

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.600
I don't think you needed to make this into four layers.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.510
Be quiet!  I had a lot of trouble thinking up four dishes.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:52.380
But couldn't you have decorated the bananas, or at least peeled them?

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.790
I tried to cut them into bunnies, but that didn't go too well.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.020
Well, they aren't apples.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.640
Yay!  It's yummy!

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.360
Hmm... let me see.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.020
Well then.

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:17.400
Oh yeah, this is the first time I've seen Yuzuyu eat the lunch I made for her.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.170
I didn't know she enjoyed eating them this much.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.560
Yuzuyu, I'm going to try even harder from now on!

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:25.660
He's crying...

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.650
Were we too rude?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.860
You did very well, Kippei.

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:32.360
Despite the bananas...

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.610
Hey, that really came out well!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.000
The way you say that...

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.180
It sounds like you think it's a miracle that it's even there at all.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.820
We would like to start the afternoon session of the competition.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.460
Could all students please return to their groups.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:07.370
We've had lots of fun today, but now we have to start our last event.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:11.860
Would the children and their parents now get ready for the scavenger hunt.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:16.470
This is our last chance!  We can't lose to the red team!

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.270
Let's do our best!

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:19.110
Yes!

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:24.650
Ready!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.620
What is it, Mama?

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.780
A ballpoint pen.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.640
That's easy!

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.870
Does anybody have a ballpoint pen?

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.060
I have one!

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.630
If we could, please.

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:47.160
We have to win now!

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.010
What is it?

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.230
A thermos.

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:53.600
Does anyone have a thermos?

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:56.020
Thermos... Where's the thermos?

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.200
I'm sure we had one.

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:59.130
A thermos, right?

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.810
Mama, a thermos!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.000
Wasn't it a ballpoint pen?

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:06.410
Papa brought a thermos.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:07.900
Papa!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.170
W-Wait a minute, Marika-chan!

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.610
Does anyone have a thermos?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:17.700
We've been beaten.

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:23.700
A thermos!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:27.840
Thank you.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.530
Let's go, Kippei-san!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:31.680
W-wait...

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:34.310
Why?

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:36.750
Marika-chan!

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.850
No!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.150
Marika-chan!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:49.140
Oh no!

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:58.510
Kippei-san, we're going to finish together!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.040
Finish?

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:03.020
I'm so embarrassed!

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:20.800
Principal, in a situation like this, how do we decide who won?

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:25.130
It doesn't really matter who won, or who lost.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.600
Just as long as they all took part.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.840
The red team and the white team have tied,

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:40.080
and now the Asou Preschool Sports Festival is over!

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.480
I'm exhausted!

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:51.890
Nee-chan sure is tough.  She went out after all that.

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:57.440
Uh-oh.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:20:59.060
What's wrong?

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.290
We only have the beginning and the end.  The middle isn't on the tape.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.090
What?!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:09.530
It must have happened at lunchtime, when we were checking that everything was okay.

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:14.310
The tape must have been left at that point, and then we recorded over it.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:20.090
Nee-chan, Yuzuyu tried so hard, what are you doing?!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.550
At least put on a CD...

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:30.580
Thank you everyone!

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:39.470
Thank you all for coming today!

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:43.040
I had lots of fun!

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.240
Thank you for bringing me home.

00:23:50.670 --> 00:23:51.670
I'll call you again soon.

00:24:00.860 --> 00:24:02.080
What's all this?

00:24:08.260 --> 00:24:09.080
You can't be serious.

00:24:19.420 --> 00:24:22.000
Yuzuyu, I'll take you to play in the sandbox!

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:23.430
No, I can't!

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:24.670
Why not?

00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:27.710
I'm going to play with Marika-chan and Ken-kun at his house.

00:24:28.870 --> 00:24:31.720
Here's my Bear-san... Mama bought it for me.

00:24:31.990 --> 00:24:33.650
Oh yeah, a letter came for you.

00:24:33.830 --> 00:24:34.710
Who's it from?

00:24:34.890 --> 00:24:35.730
It's from your Mama.

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:38.140
Really?  It's from my Mama?!

00:24:39.070 --> 00:24:40.800
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:41.220 --> 00:24:43.570
Bear-san, Carrot, Papa and Mama

00:24:44.030 --> 00:24:46.060
What did the letter say?

00:24:46.280 --> 00:24:47.570
I want to know!
